#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:101
msgid ""
"**Geometry and Feature Edges Dispatcher Filters** Two new dispatcher filters "
"(`vtkGeometryFilterDispatcher` and `vtkFeatureEdgesDispatcher`) provide "
"unified geometry extraction and feature edge detection across all VTK data "
"types. ([Author notes](9.7/add-geometry-and-feature-edges-dispatchers.md))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:105
msgid ""
"**Add vtkConvexHull filter** New `vtkPointSetAlgorithm` computes convex "
"hulls in 1/2/3D with O(n), O(n log n), or O(n log n) average complexity "
"respectively."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:108
msgid ""
"**vtkHilbertCurveSorter: Space-Filling Curve Ordering** New filter sorts "
"data points along a Hilbert curve for locality-preserving space-filling "
"curve ordering."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:111
msgid ""
"**vtkJumpAndWalkCellLocator: A new cell locator based on Jump and Walk "
"algorithm** New `vtkAbstractCellLocator` subclass implementing jump-and-walk "
"algorithm; `vtkFindCellStrategy` classes deprecated. ([Author notes](9.7/add-"
"vtkJumpAndWalkCellLocator.md))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:115
msgid ""
"**Add vtkPTemporalPathLineFilter for partitioned dataset support** Extends "
"`vtkTemporalPathLineFilter` with `vtkPartitionedDataSet` support and "
"parallel selection allgather."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:118
msgid ""
"**Add vtkSurfaceNetsAtlas** New filter exposes SurfaceNets output as "
"queryable label atlas with regions and patches; extensive API for post-"
"processing. ([Author notes](9.7/add-vtkSurfaceNetsAtlas.md))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:122
msgid ""
"**Voronoi Framework** New parallel 2D/3D Voronoi tessellation and Delaunay "
"triangulation framework with `vtkVoronoiFlower2D/3D` and "
"`vtkGeneralizedSurfaceNets3D` filters. ([Author notes](9.7/add-voronoi-"
"framework.md))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:126
#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:290
#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:416
msgid "I/O"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:128
msgid ""
"**CanReadFile support** Extended `CanReadFile` support to 22 readers "
"including `vtkDataSetReader`, `vtkXMLReader`, `vtkSTLReader`, "
"`vtkGLTFImporter`, and more."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:131
msgid ""
"**Added an IFC reader based on IfcOpenShell library** New `vtkIFCReader` "
"imports Industry Foundation Classes (BIM) data, converting parametric "
"surfaces to meshes using OpenCascade."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:134
msgid ""
"**CGNS Polyhedron Flip Face Orientation** `vtkCGNSReader` now has "
"`FlipFaceNormals` option to correct inconsistent face winding in polyhedral "
"datasets."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:137
msgid ""
"**OBJ reader/writer RGB/RGBA color array support** `vtkOBJReader` now reads "
"color data from OBJ files; `vtkOBJWriter` can write color arrays when "
"manually configured."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:140
msgid ""
"**PLY reader/writer texture coordinates (s, t) support** `vtkPLYReader` now "
"reads (s, t) texture coordinates; `vtkPLYWriter` supports "
"`SetTextureCoordinatesNameToST`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:143
msgid ""
"**vtkGLTFImporter: Detect binary stream automatically** `vtkGLTFImporter` "
"now automatically detects binary streams; `StreamIsBinary` property "
"deprecated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:146
msgid ""
"**vtkGLTFExporter: Export object names to glTF files** `vtkGLTFExporter` now "
"uses actor object names for mesh and node names in exported glTF files."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:149
msgid ""
"**NanoVDB writer** New `vtkNanoVDBWriter` exports `vtkImageData` to NanoVDB "
"file format."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:152
msgid ""
"**VTKHDF: Add support for dataset attributes** VTKHDF now supports dataset "
"attributes (normals, scalars, global ids, etc.) via HDF5 'Attribute' field; "
"version bumped to 2.6."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:155
msgid ""
"**vtkRectilinearGrid & vtkStructuredGrid support in VTKHDF** VTKHDF "
"specification now supports Rectilinear and Structured Grids with both simple "
"and time-dependent data."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:158
msgid ""
"**vtkMPASReader: Read primary grid from MPAS** [Comparison of primary and "
"dual grids in MPAS](imgs/9.7/mpas-grids.jpg) `vtkMPASReader` now supports "
"`UsePrimaryGrid` option to read Voronoi primary grid instead of Delaunay "
"dual grid. ([Author notes](9.7/mpas-primary-grid.md))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:162
msgid ""
"**vtkFidesReader supports reading from Conduit nodes** `vtkFidesReader` now "
"allows passing in-memory Conduit nodes directly, bypassing the filesystem "
"entirely. Supports both C++ and Python interfaces with automatic reference "
"counting. ([Author notes](9.7/iofides-supports-conduit.md))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:165
msgid ""
"**New vtkTestUtilities API to test data against file** `vtkTestUtilities::"
"CompareWithFile()` and `RegressionTest()` provide easy VTKHDF data "
"comparison; writes baseline on failure."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:168
#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:302
#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:471
msgid "Interaction"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:170
msgid ""
"**Camera Manipulators Enhanced** VTK now provides a simpler way to bind "
"different kinds of camera movement to a combination of mouse button and "
"modifier keys using `vtkInteractorStyleManipulator`. ([Author notes](9.7/add-"
"camera-manipulators.md))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:174
msgid ""
"**Widget reference tracking** Interactor now maintains references to "
"`vtkInteractorObserver` widgets when `TrackInteractorObserverInstances` "
"enabled; all VTK widgets updated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:177
msgid ""
"**Add zSpace custom stylus events** zSpace module now supports custom stylus "
"events via `vtkZSpaceSDKManager` configuration; public event handlers "
"removed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:180
msgid ""
"**vtkCameraOrientationWidget supports rotating about CenterOfRotation** "
"`vtkCameraOrientationWidget` now respects the center of rotation provided by "
"the associated interactor style. A new `UseCenterOfRotation` property "
"(default `false`) controls this: when disabled (legacy default) the widget "
"rotates the camera about its focal point, and when enabled it rotates about "
"the interactor style's center of rotation (`vtkInteractorStyle::"
"GetCenterOfRotation`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:183
#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:307
#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:476
msgid "Rendering"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:185
msgid ""
"**Add skybox blur capability** `vtkRenderer` now supports skybox blurring "
"via `SetSkyboxBlurEnabled()` and `SetSkyboxBlurRadius()`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:188
msgid "[skybox_blur_image](imgs/9.7/add-skybox-blur-image.png)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:190
msgid ""
"**Add skybox rendering support in WebGPU** WebGPU backend now supports "
"skybox rendering with cube map textures and Float32Filterable feature for "
"HDR."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:193
msgid ""
"**ANARI material library support** Unified `vtkRenderMaterialLibrary` base "
"class with `vtkANARIMaterialLibrary` and `vtkOSPRayMaterialLibrary` "
"implementations. ([Author notes](9.7/anari-materials-library-support.md))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:197
msgid ""
"**macOS now supports corner resize mouse cursors** `vtkCocoaRenderWindow` "
"and `vtkCocoaHardwareWindow` now support corner resize cursors on macOS 15 "
"Sequoia."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:200
msgid ""
"**Architectural Update: Hardware Window, Wayland, and WebGPU** Major "
"architectural overhaul separating graphics from windowing via "
"`vtkHardwareWindow`; native Wayland, WebGPU, Metal support added. ([Author "
"notes](9.7/hardware-windows-and-wayland.md))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:204
msgid ""
"**Support 16-bit Textures on GLES 3.0 and WebAssembly** Comprehensive 16-bit "
"texture support with GL_EXT_texture_norm16 detection and GPU-assisted "
"conversion strategies. ([Author notes](9.7/volume-rendering-16bit-wasm.md))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:208
msgid ""
"**WebGPU Lighting and Coincident Topology Support** WebGPU backend now "
"supports all VTK light types and coincident topology depth offsets for z-"
"fighting resolution."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:211
msgid ""
"**vtkBatchedLabeledDataMapper: Implementation** New backend-agnostic "
"`vtkBatchedLabeledDataMapper` with glyph atlas batching; "
"`vtkFastLabeledDataMapper` deprecated. ([Author notes](9.7/"
"vtkBatchedLabeledDataMapper-implementation.md))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:215
msgid ""
"**vtkAxis: Vertical labels support** `vtkAxis` now supports vertical label "
"orientation via `SetVerticalLabels()`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:218
msgid ""
"**vtkAxis: Avoid overlapping labels** `vtkAxis` now supports "
"`SetOverlappingLabels(false)` to prevent label overlap."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:221
#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:321
#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:524
msgid "WebAssembly"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:223
msgid ""
"**Add WebXR Module** New `Rendering/WebXR` module provides VR/AR support on "
"web via WebXR API with Emscripten compilation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:226
msgid ""
"**Use HTML canvas in VTK.wasm without id** `specialHTMLTargets` mapping "
"allows interfacing HTML canvas elements without id attributes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:229
msgid ""
"**Session management: Print Objects To String** `vtkStandaloneSession` now "
"supports printing VTK object information to strings in WASM; JavaScript API "
"updated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:232
msgid ""
"**Add methods to clean up observers in vtkSession** `vtkSession` C API now "
"provides `UnObserveAll` methods for observer cleanup; exposed in WASM "
"session interface."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:235
#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:329
msgid "Python"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:237
msgid ""
"**Look up algorithms in a Pipeline by object_name** `Pipeline` now supports "
"`pipeline[name]` lookup to find algorithms by `SetObjectName()` without "
"holding references."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:240
msgid ""
"**Dictionary interface for vtkDataArraySelection** `vtkDataArraySelection` "
"now supports a Python dictionary interface for getting, setting, and "
"deleting array enable/disable states using standard dictionary syntax "
"(`sel[\"Pressure\"] = True`). ([Author notes](9.7/pythonic-array-selection."
"md))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:244
msgid "ThirdParty"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:246
msgid ""
"**Add a Conduit module** `VTK::conduit` module allows external Conduit "
"dependency; `ORDER_DEPENDS` enforces consistency with `VTK::catalyst`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:249
msgid "Changes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:253
msgid ""
"**Name targets after library names** VTK module targets are now named after "
"their library names (e.g., vtkCommonCore) to avoid conflicts with vendored "
"dependencies."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:256
msgid ""
"**vtkModuleWrapPython renames Python module targets** Python module targets "
"now use `Py` prefix to avoid naming conflicts between module and Python "
"variant targets."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:259
msgid ""
"**Python 3.10 is now minimum supported** Official support for Python 3.9 has "
"been dropped; VTK now requires Python 3.10 or later."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:262
msgid ""
"**Switch VTK_ENABLE_OSPRAY default to OFF** `VTK_ENABLE_OSPRAY` option now "
"defaults to OFF; users must manually enable it when building the "
"RenderingRaytracing module."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:267
msgid ""
"**Convert implicit arrays to templated classes** `vtkAffineArray`, "
"`vtkCompositeArray`, `vtkConstantArray`, and others are now concrete "
"templated classes instead of typedefs, allowing Python instantiation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:270
msgid ""
"**Deprecate classes/functions that use GetVoidPointer()** "
"`vtkSMPContourGrid`, `vtkSMPMergePoints`, and others deprecated; new array "
"ranges extended to support all concrete array subclasses. ([Author notes]"
"(9.7/deprecate-classes-functions-that-use-GetVoidPointer.md))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:274
msgid ""
"**vtkDataArrayAccessor: Replace with vtk::DataArrayRange** "
"`vtkDataArrayAccessor` usage replaced with more modern `vtk::"
"DataArrayValueRange` and `vtk::DataArrayTupleRange` throughout codebase."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:279
msgid ""
"**Rename VTKCompositeDataArray to VTKPartitionedArray** "
"`VTKCompositeDataArray` extracted and renamed to `VTKPartitionedArray`; "
"legacy class remains for backward compatibility."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:284
msgid ""
"**vtkAggregateDataSetFilter: Add Target Process** New `TargetProcess` "
"property controls whether data aggregates to `ROOT_PROCESS` or "
"`PROCESS_WITH_MOST_POINTS`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:287
msgid ""
"**Deprecate vtkImageThreshold and switch to vtkImageBinaryThreshold** "
"`vtkImageThreshold` deprecated in favor of `vtkImageBinaryThreshold` with "
"clearer API for threshold modes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:292
msgid ""
"**Proper caching in vtkHDFReader** `vtkHDFReader` caching reworked for all "
"types including `vtkPartitionedDataSetCollection` and "
"`vtkMultiBlockDataSet`; `UseCache` now true by default. ([Author notes](9.7/"
"vtkhdf-improvements.md))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:296
msgid ""
"**Deserialize functions return status** Deserialization functions now return "
"bool status indicating success/failure; previously returned void."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:299
msgid ""
"**vtkWriter::Write() now return the correct value** `vtkWriter::Write()` now "
"returns false on failure; `vtkWriter::WriteData` deprecated in favor of "
"`WriteDataAndReturn`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:304
msgid ""
"**CenterOfRotation moved up to vtkInteractorStyle** The `CenterOfRotation` "
"property previously defined on `vtkInteractorStyleManipulator` now lives on "
"the `vtkInteractorStyle` base class. Existing code is unaffected since the "
"accessors keep the same signatures and are simply inherited; all interactor "
"styles now expose the property, so classes outside `VTK::InteractionStyle` "
"(for example camera-manipulating widgets) can read and write the center of "
"rotation without depending on a concrete style subclass."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:309
msgid ""
"**Change lookup table log scale debug type** `vtkLookUpTable` now logs "
"Warning instead of Debug when log scale set with invalid table range."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:312
msgid ""
"**Modify vtkRenderer's protected member** `vtkRenderer::PropArrayCount` "
"removed; `PropArray` replaced with `std::vector`; `vtkSkybox` kept separate "
"in `BackgroundProp`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:315
msgid ""
"**Update required Dawn version for WebGPU builds** Required Dawn version for "
"WebGPU builds updated to v20260421.125655."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:318
msgid ""
"**Bump ANARI version to v0.15.0** ANARI library tested and supported at "
"latest version v0.15.0."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:323
msgid ""
"**Make vtkOpenXRManager private** `vtkOpenXRManager` moved to `vtk::detail::"
"vtkOpenXRManager`; public API moved to `vtkOpenXRRenderWindow`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:326
msgid ""
"**Remote sessions drop deserialization constructors unsuitable for the web** "
"`vtkRemoteSession` now removes the deserialization constructors of all "
"classes that cannot work on the web platform, generalizing the earlier "
"handling that only dropped `vtkOpenGLPolyDataMapper` and "
"`vtkOpenGLPolyDataMapper2D`. States naming such classes fall back to the "
"nearest superclass constructor; for example a state naming "
"`vtkGenericRenderWindowInteractor` now constructs through "
"`vtkRenderWindowInteractor`, whose object factory instantiates "
"`vtkWebAssemblyRenderWindowInteractor`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:331
msgid ""
"**numpy type mapping follows numpy's underlying C type** `vtkmodules.util."
"numpy_support` and the Python template subscript operator now map numpy "
"dtypes to VTK types by the dtype's underlying C type (its `dtype.char`) "
"rather than a hardwired table of numpy scalar types. On LP64 platforms "
"(Linux and macOS) `numpy.int64` is C `long`, so `numpy_to_vtk` now returns a "
"`vtkLongArray` (`VTK_LONG`) instead of a `vtkTypeInt64Array` "
"(`VTK_LONG_LONG`), and `numpy.uint64` maps to `VTK_UNSIGNED_LONG`; `numpy."
"longlong` still maps to `VTK_LONG_LONG`, and Windows behavior is unchanged. "
"The data is unaffected and round-trips losslessly — only type identity "
"changes — so code that tests for an array class or type code should check "
"widths instead (e.g. `GetDataTypeSize() == 8`) or accept both classes. "
"Template subscripting follows the same rule, so "
"`vtkAOSDataArrayTemplate[numpy.int64]` and `vtkAOSDataArrayTemplate[numpy."
"dtype('int64')]` now resolve to the same instantiation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:334
msgid ""
"**numpy_support type size/code constants removed** The module-level "
"constants `VTK_ID_TYPE_SIZE`, `ID_TYPE_CODE`, `VTK_LONG_TYPE_SIZE`, "
"`LONG_TYPE_CODE`, and `ULONG_TYPE_CODE` are removed. Use "
"`get_numpy_array_type()` to resolve the numpy type for a VTK type code (e.g. "
"`get_numpy_array_type(VTK_ID_TYPE)` in place of `ID_TYPE_CODE`) and the "
"resulting dtype's `itemsize` in place of the size constants."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:337
msgid ""
"**get_vtk_to_numpy_typemap() returns a copy** `get_vtk_to_numpy_typemap()` "
"again returns a copy of the VTK-to-numpy mapping rather than the module's "
"own dictionary, restoring its earlier behavior; mutating the returned "
"dictionary no longer perturbs conversions elsewhere in the process."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:340
msgid "Fixes/improvements"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:344
msgid ""
"**Replace most GetVoidPointer instances (Part 2)** Removed ~48% of remaining "
"`GetVoidPointer()` usages using `vtkArrayDispatch` and range methods; marked "
"remaining usages as safe. ([Author notes](9.7/replace-GetVoidPointer-usages."
"md))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:348
msgid ""
"**Add tag mangling reset in vtkCommunicators** Tag mangling in "
"`vtkCommunicator::Send()` now resets when mangled tag exceeds maximum value; "
"`vtkMPICommunicator::InitializeAttributes()` retrieves MPI_TAG_UB."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:351
msgid ""
"**Removed signed/unsigned errors with type checks** "
"`vtkVariantInlineOperators.h` now has overloaded `IsSigned()` and "
"`IsFloatingPoint()` accepting unsigned int to eliminate compiler warnings."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:354
msgid ""
"**Polyhedron faces lost when cells are handed to SetCells()** "
"`vtkUnstructuredGrid::SetCells()` interpreted its cell array as a legacy "
"face stream whenever the mesh contained polyhedra, so callers copying cells "
"from `GetCells()` and passing them back had point lists misread as face "
"descriptions. `vtkExtractCellsAlongPolyLine`, `vtkOverlappingCellsDetector`, "
"and the `vtkUnstructuredGrid` (de)serialization helper now carry polyhedron "
"faces through explicitly via `SetPolyhedralCells()`. ([Author notes](9.7/fix-"
"polyhedron-faces-lost-by-setcells.md))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:360
msgid ""
"**vtkExtractEdges: Improve Performance** `vtkExtractEdges` now multithreaded "
"regardless of `UseAllPoints` setting, providing significant performance "
"improvement."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:363
msgid ""
"**vtkDelaunay2D performance optimization** `vtkDelaunay2D` uses lightweight "
"internal mesh with O(1) edge pointers; `UseHilbertSorter` option provides up "
"to 40x speedup."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:366
msgid ""
"**vtkDelaunay3D performance optimization** `vtkDelaunay3D` uses lightweight "
"internal mesh with O(1) face pointers, yielding approximately 13x speedup."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:369
msgid ""
"**CellLocators: Make sure that when a tolerance parameter is available it "
"can be used** Cell locator tolerance parameters in `InsideCellBounds`, "
"`IntersectWithLine`, `FindCell`, etc. now actually used; `vtkLocator::"
"Tolerance` deprecated. ([Author notes](9.7/cell-locators-tolerance.md))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:373
msgid ""
"**Add use of implicit arrays in some filters** "
"`vtkAppendCompositeDataLeaves`, `vtkAppendDataSets`, `vtkAppendFilter`, "
"`vtkAppendPolyData`, and `vtkGhostCellsGenerator` now optionally use "
"implicit arrays."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:376
msgid ""
"**Polyhedron clipping and contouring uses López polygon-tracing algorithm** "
"`vtkPolyhedron::Contour()` and `Clip()` now use López algorithm working "
"directly on faces without triangulation; requires outward-facing normals. "
"([Author notes](9.7/polyhedron-lopez-algorithm.md))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:380
msgid ""
"**Correct triangulation of non-convex polyhedron contour polygons** "
"`vtkPolyhedron` contouring now ear-clips polygons instead of fanning, "
"correctly handling non-convex iso-surface polygons."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:383
msgid ""
"**vtkPolyhedron: remove per-call allocation from IsInside** `vtkPolyhedron::"
"IsInside` now triangulates faces using the shared allocation-free "
"`vtkPolygon::EarClipPolygon3D` instead of constructing a new `vtkPolygon` "
"and `vtkIdList` per call, removing allocation churn from the streamline and "
"probe filters' hot path. ([Author notes](9.7/fix-polyhedron-isinside-"
"allocations.md))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:387
msgid ""
"**Fix vtkCellValidator for vtkVoxel and vtkPixel** `vtkCellValidator` now "
"correctly accesses point coordinates for `vtkVoxel` and `vtkPixel` when "
"positioning the `IntersectingEdges` flag; a wrong point id previously could "
"lead to a crash."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:390
msgid ""
"**vtkProbeFilter: Fix logic on SnapToCellWithClosestPoint and tolerance** "
"`vtkProbeFilter` now correctly handles `SnapToCellWithClosestPoint` by "
"computing coordinates directly; snapping radius and tolerance handling "
"improved."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:393
msgid ""
"**vtkSurfaceNets3D: Identify and correct non-manifold points** "
"`vtkSurfaceNets3D` detects non-manifold neighborhoods and resolves them; "
"adds `NonManifoldTableIndices` point-data array. ([Author notes](9.7/"
"vtkSurfaceNets3D-non-manifold-improvements.md))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:397
msgid ""
"**Improved vtkCellGrid evaluation performance and API** `vtkDGEvaluator::"
"ClassifyPoints` rewritten for substantial performance with convex hull pre-"
"filtering; `EvaluatePositions` merged into `ClassifyPoints`. ([Author notes]"
"(9.7/improve-cell-grid-probing.md))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:401
msgid ""
"**Mesh Cache Usage** `vtkAppendDataSets`, `vtkExtractGeometry`, and "
"`vtkTransformFilter` now use `vtkDataObjectMeshCache` for performance "
"optimization."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:404
msgid ""
"**vtkExplodeDataSet partitions name from FieldData** `vtkExplodeDataSet` can "
"now retrieve partition names from FieldData array with optional scalar value "
"mapping."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:407
msgid ""
"**vtkRandomHyperTreeGridSource: consistent behavior in distributed** "
"`vtkRandomHyperTreeGridSource` output now consistent between serial and "
"parallel execution; mask generation rewritten."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:410
msgid ""
"**vtkGenericCell DeepCopy and ShallowCopy fix** `vtkGenericCell` DeepCopy "
"and ShallowCopy now properly handle different types and support copying "
"generic cells."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:413
msgid ""
"**Fix nearest-neighbour interpolation in vtkDataSetAttributes** "
"`vtkDataSetAttributes` nearest-neighbour interpolation fixed by correcting "
"maxWeight variable type from vtkIdType to double."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:418
msgid ""
"**vtkGLTFReader: Fix texture coordinate handling** `vtkGLTFReader` now "
"correctly handles models with multiple texture coordinate sets by inspecting "
"materials."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:421
msgid ""
"**CONVERGE reader: consistent polyhedron face orientation** "
"`vtkCONVERGECFDReader` now reverses shared interior faces for their neighbor "
"cell so every polyhedron has consistently outward-facing normals, fixing "
"holes and broken cross sections when slicing or contouring CONVERGE "
"polyhedral meshes. ([Author notes](9.7/convergecfd-polyhedron-face-winding."
"md))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:425
msgid ""
"**Improve vtkFLUENTCFFReader** `vtkFLUENTCFFReader` now supports "
"`RenameArrays` option and face zone reading with related data arrays."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:428
msgid ""
"**vtkFLUENTReader now supports larger files** Fixed crash in "
"`vtkFLUENTReader` when parsing zones too large; moved virtual functions to "
"private scope; reduced memory usage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:431
msgid ""
"**vtkVRMLImporter general fixes** Cone now defaults to Z axis; appearance/"
"Transform nodes support USE/DEF; Extrusion node type added with full support."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:434
msgid ""
"**Fix metaimage direction ignored** MetaImage reader and writer now properly "
"handle direction matrix for `vtkImage` objects."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:437
msgid ""
"**Fix legacy I/O handling of Inf/NaN values** VTK legacy format readers now "
"properly handle Inf and NaN values in ASCII files."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:440
msgid ""
"**Added vector overrun detection for vtkBMPReader** `vtkBMPReader` now "
"detects vector overruns and prevents reading past file end on invalid/"
"garbled BMP files."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:443
msgid ""
"**Added vector max size allocation detection for vtkHDRReader** "
"`vtkHDRReader` now detects vector max size allocation and parsing errors, "
"preventing reads past file end."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:446
msgid ""
"**Added vector overrun detection for vtkTGAReader** `vtkTGAReader` now "
"detects vector overruns preventing invalid memory access on corrupt TGA "
"files."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:449
msgid ""
"**Improved vtkTGAReader::CanReadFile validation** `vtkTGAReader::"
"CanReadFile` now checks bits-per-pixel field in addition to image type, "
"reducing false positives."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:452
msgid ""
"**Stricter CanReadFile validation for vtkTGAReader** `vtkTGAReader::"
"CanReadFile` performs multi-layer validation including TGA 2.0 footer and "
"header cross-validation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:455
msgid ""
"**vtkXMLCompositeDataReader: Refactoring subclasses** "
"`vtkXMLCompositeDataReader` subclasses refactored for consistent metadata "
"handling; block/array selection support added."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:458
msgid ""
"**Pass through nullptr objects as JSON null in serialization** `nullptr` "
"objects now consistently serialized as JSON null; deserialization correctly "
"interprets null as `nullptr`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:461
msgid ""
"**vtkMPASReader: Fixed memory management** `vtkMPASReader` temporary array "
"management improved; protected members made private."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:464
msgid ""
"**AMR ghost cell support and blanking fixes** `vtkAMReXGridReader` reads "
"ghost cells and creates properly marked arrays; `vtkAMRUtilities` and "
"`vtkOverlappingAMRMetaData` blanking fixed. ([Author notes](9.7/amr-ghost-"
"cell-support.md))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:468
msgid ""
"**vtkMPASReader: Support nodal main multifab** `vtkAMReXGridReader` now "
"detects nodal main multifabs and exposes variables as point data."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:473
msgid ""
"**vtkTrackballRotate: fix rotation about a non-default center** "
"`vtkTrackballRotate` now correctly rotates the camera about the center of "
"rotation set on `vtkInteractorStyleManipulator`; previously the rotation "
"transform was missing the translation to the center of rotation, so the "
"camera rotated about the world origin and drifted away from the scene on "
"every mouse move whenever a non-zero center of rotation was set."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:478
msgid ""
"**Linear cells improvements: Add Drawing, Clip, use contour tables** Linear "
"cells now have documentation drawings; clip methods implemented using "
"vtkMarchingCellsClipCases; contour tables consolidated. ([Author notes](9.7/"
"linear-cells-improvements.md))"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../release/_9.7-stripped.md:482
msgid ""
"**VTK Wedge Cell Types: Fix Point Ordering and Correctness** Wedge and "
"related cell types now have correct point ordering matching parametric "
"coordinates; triangulation and volume correctness fixed. ([Author notes](9.7/"
"fix-wedge-point-ordering.md))"
msgstr ""

